The slide’s evolution—CLAUDE.md → memory tools → skills → shared memory files—is the same progression Pantheon explored:

1. Store conventions externally.
2. Make memory readable and writable.
3. Convert knowledge into procedural operators.
4. Share those procedures across agents and instances.
5. Let current state select and compose the next prompt.
6. Feed results and deltas back into the external substrate.

